L'application mobile Bison Futé fournit une information fiabilisée sur l'ensemble du réseau routier national (tous les événements et leurs conséquences proviennent des gestionnaires du réseau routier national) et en temps réel (données actualisées toutes les 3 à 6 minutes).

Vous trouverez en particulier :
- les prévisions de trafic sous la forme de jours colorés : vert, orange, rouge ou noir ;
- les prévisions détaillées précisant les axes les plus circulés, les horaires à éviter ainsi que des conseils pour vos déplacements ;
- une carte des événements routiers en temps réel (route fermée incident, panne, accident, bouchon, chantier, etc.) avec leur localisation, leur description, leurs impacts sur la circulation et, quand c’est possible, la durée prévisible des perturbations ;
- l'état du trafic dans 17 grandes agglomérations ;
- les conditions de conduite hivernales sur le réseau routier national pendant la période de viabilité hivernale (de mi-novembre à mi-mars) ;

L’application Bison Futé sur smartphone est disponible gratuitement.
Elle ne comporte aucun message publicitaire.

N'hésitez pas à nous faire part de vos idées d'évolutions de l'application, nous serons heureux de vous répondre et de les prendre en compte.

Discover The Netherlands with the Efita cycling – route app!

Start exploring beautiful cycle routes along junctions and enjoy unique stops such as cosy cafés, fascinating museums and other interesting hotspots. In our app, you will discover thousands of routes, from a short round trip to a full cycling holiday.

A world of cycle routes

Whether you are a novice or an experienced cyclist, our app makes cycling easy and fun. There is always a route nearby. Just pick a route, hop on your bike and start exploring! Our routes are carefully compiled by experts and often in cooperation with nature organisations and tourism partners.

Advantages of the Efita cycling – route app
●	Navigate effortlessly with our smart route guidance;
●	Start one of the many available cycle routes within a few clicks;
●	Extensive choice of themed routes;
●	Filter routes by location, distance and theme;
●	Discover unique sights and places to eat;
●	All information easily available and in multiple languages;
●	Voice guidance and save favourite routes;
●	Daily updates of routes and nodes;
●	Routes are also available as GPX files.

Pit stops in the Efita cycling – route app

Our network of pit stops on our routes is unique and diverse, from terraces and museums to forts and castles. These locations enrich your cycling day and can all be found along our carefully mapped routes.

Planning your own cycle routes? No need!

Our app offers thousands of ready-made themed cycle routes. Simply choose your ideal route and start enjoying right away.

How does it work?

1.	Open the Efita cycling – route app.
2.	Choose a route or search, via city, postcode or directly in your area.
3.	Filter by distance or theme of your choice.
4.	Start the route and follow the instructions to the first junction.
5.	Let the adventure begin!

Create wonderful memories with our Premium cycle routes
Go for a Premium cycle route if you are looking for a unique cycling experience. Each Premium route offers you the following:

●	Professionally compiled: Our experienced editors carefully compile each route;
●	Rich background information: Learn more about the places you visit;
●	Special themes: Discover routes that go beyond the landscape;
●	Comprehensive photo reports: Enjoy stunning images that enrich your trip;
●	Audio information: Listen to stories and facts about hotspots along the way;
●	All Premium app features: Use all the advanced features in our app during your tour.

Choose a Premium route if you want more than just cycling.

Always create the best memories with a Premium subscription
First, download the free basic version of the Efita cycling – route app. Are you a passionate cyclist? Then consider our Premium subscription for lots of extra benefits:

●	Access to all routes: Enjoy both Basic and Premium cycle routes;
●	New routes every month: Receive five new Premium cycle routes every month;
●	Extensive voice guidance: Cycle easily with clear audio instructions;
●	No ads: Experience no interruptions during your ride;
●	Eco mode: Save battery while on the move;
●	Multiple screen views: Customise the app to your preferences;
●	Off-route alert: Always stay on the right track with our handy alert;
●	Audio information on the go: Learn more about places of interest with recorded information on Premium routes;
●	Customised bike profile: Set the app for your specific cycling needs;
●	Premium newsletter: Get great discounts and the latest updates straight to your inbox (optional).

With a Premium subscription, get even more out of your cycling trips and enjoy every day!

Stay connected with Bicycle Network

Follow us for the latest updates and inspiration on social media or via the newsletter.

Questions or suggestions?

Do you have questions about the Fietsnetwerk app? Get in touch via support@fietsnetwerk.nl. 

Your privacy

Your privacy is important to us. View the privacy policy on our website: https://www.fietsnetwerk.nl/privacy-statement/

Miio app allows you to comfortably charge your electric vehicle in Portugal, France and Spain, get to know the final price beforehand and interact with the community. 

Miio makes it possible to:
- Charge your vehicle through the app or physical card;
- Have full control over your expenses, before, during and after your charging session;
- View the most complete charging station map, with power indicators, plug availability and type of venue;
- Get help to choose between charging stations and plugs, according to your vehicle specificities;
- Monitor your charging session from distance and in real time, with smart alarms; 
- Comment, rate and add photos to charging stations;
- Be notified about state and price changes, or about new stations; 
- Save your favorite or recent charging stations;
- Plan your trips: where to stop and charge, how long it will take and how much it will cost you;
- Earn bonus with our campaigns;
And much more!
